{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"店員","text":"──いらっしゃいませ","trans":"——欢迎光临","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"店員","text":"何か、お探しでしょうか……？","trans":"请问，在找什么吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110010","name":"甜花","text":"あ、あぅ……\r\nえと、その……","trans":"啊、呜……\n那个，就是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110020","name":"甜花","text":"────だ、だいじょぶ……\r\nです……！","trans":"————没、没事……\n的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"店員","text":"そうでしたか、失礼しました……！","trans":"是这样吗，抱歉……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"店員","text":"何かございましたら\r\nお気軽にお声がけくださいね？","trans":"有什么需要的话\n请随时叫我哦？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110050","name":"甜花","text":"（──こないだの、お花……）","trans":"（——上次的，那个花……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110060","name":"甜花","text":"（すぐ見つかるって、\r\n思ってたのに、な……）","trans":"（明明以为……\n马上就能找到的……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110070","name":"甜花","text":"（……ピンクの……\r\nちっちゃいやつ……）","trans":"（……粉色的……\n小小的那个……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110080","name":"甜花","text":"（いっぱいあって……\r\nどれか、わかんない……）","trans":"（有好多……\n不知道是哪个……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110090","name":"甜花","text":"…………\r\nあぅ……","trans":"…………\n呜……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-29","name":"店員","text":"──あのー……","trans":"——那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110100","name":"甜花","text":"ひゃいっ……！","trans":"呀啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-31","name":"店員","text":"ああっ、すみません\r\n随分長く迷われているみたいだったので……！","trans":"啊，抱歉\n看您好像犹豫了很久……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110110","name":"甜花","text":"あ──\r\nは、はい……","trans":"啊——\n是、是的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-33","name":"店員","text":"お花……\r\nプレゼント用でしょうか？","trans":"花……\n是送人的吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110120","name":"甜花","text":"……じ、じゃなくて……！","trans":"……不、不是……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-35","name":"店員","text":"ご自宅用ですね？","trans":"是自己用的吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110130","name":"甜花","text":"ご自宅用、です……！","trans":"是自己用的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110140","name":"甜花","text":"────そ、その……","trans":"————那、那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110150","name":"甜花","text":"えと……\r\nピンクの、小さい花……","trans":"那个……\n粉色的、小花……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110160","name":"甜花","text":"──を……\r\n全部の種類、ください……！","trans":"——请给我……\n所有种类……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-42","name":"店員","text":"全部ですか……！？","trans":"全部吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110170","name":"甜花","text":"全部です……！","trans":"全部……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-49","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──甜花！","trans":"——甜花！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-50","name":"プロデューサー","text":"すまん、待たせちゃったな","trans":"抱歉，让你等了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110180","name":"甜花","text":"あ……\r\nううん……大丈夫……！","trans":"啊……\n不……没事……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110190","name":"甜花","text":"甜花……\r\nお花買ってた、から……！","trans":"甜花……\n在买花，所以……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-53","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おお、そうなのか……！？","trans":"哦，是吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110210","name":"甜花","text":"……この前、プロデューサーさんに\r\nお花、買ってもらったの……","trans":"……上次，制作人\n买花给我了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110220","name":"甜花","text":"なんか……\r\nすごく、よかったから……","trans":"总觉得……\n特别，好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-60","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……それにしても\r\n随分たくさん買ったんだなあ","trans":"……话说回来\n买了好多啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110240","name":"甜花","text":"こないだのお花……\r\n欲しかったけど……名前、わかんなかった……","trans":"上次那个花……\n想要，可是……不知道名字……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110250","name":"甜花","text":"でも──\r\nにへへ……心……満たされてる……！","trans":"不过——\n嘻嘻……心……被填满了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-65","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ\r\nそれはよかった……！","trans":"哈哈\n那太好了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110270","name":"甜花","text":"あ──\r\nでね……","trans":"啊——\n然后呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110280","name":"甜花","text":"ね、このお花……\r\n甜花に似合う……？","trans":"呐，这个花……\n适合甜花吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-72","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──！\r\n……はは","trans":"——！\n……哈哈","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-73","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、やっぱり似合うなって\r\n思ってたところだ","trans":"嗯，我正好在想\n果然很适合","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110300","name":"甜花","text":"こっちのお花は……？","trans":"这个花呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-79","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おっ、その花はもっと似合うな……？","trans":"哦，那朵更适合……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110310","name":"甜花","text":"ほんと……？\r\nにへへ……","trans":"真的……？\n嘻嘻……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110320","name":"甜花","text":"次は……\r\nこれ……！","trans":"接下来……\n这个……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-85","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん、それも似合うよ……！","trans":"嗯，那个也很适合……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013110330","name":"甜花","text":"──じゃあ、\r\nこのお花……！","trans":"——那\n这个花……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-89","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、似合う似合う──！","trans":"嗯，适合适合——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}